<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">veil-rend</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Veil Rend</ansi> spell tears open the boundary between the material world
and the Veil itself, releasing an explosion of raw unbound energy
that scours everything nearby. The most destructive area spell in the
elemental school — catastrophic cost, catastrophic effect.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast veil-rend</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Area
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 28
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 200
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — armor and constitution resist the raw energy
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Catastrophic damage to all enemies in the room

